{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>על נפש מת לא יבא</b>. To tell you that if the Shekhinah rests upon him on account of his nazirite crown, they should not say that he is one who consults the dead. 30 times 'נדר' and nazirite-rites are written in the parashah — for ordinary naziriteship is 30 days, and so too יהיה עולה שלשים."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:21:34.584450611Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}